 1 1 at a  time trying to reach customers you're  now connecting with an influencer who  they like what you're doing they can  introduce you to tens hundreds thousands  hundreds of thousands millions of people  it's much more efficient it's a  fantastic use of time and it's your  fastest way to grow your company number  3 is spend time helping a customer you  should be doing this every day look at  the people who are buying from you look  at the people who are leads look at the  people who are leaving comments on your  social channels find a way to give back  and help them you want to create  goodwill you want to create a sense of  you know this person cares about me they  like me they want me to do well they  care about the problems that I'm going  through and if you help a customer every  single day you'll build up a lot of  word-of-mouth you'll build up a lot of  chatter you build up a lot of goodwill  towards your business and you need to do  it this is why I spend time every single  day in my youtube comments from you guys  one because it's a good you know  business thing to do but to like I enjoy  it right it makes me feel good and will  help you feel good knowing that you're  giving back and helping somebody out  even if it doesn't lead to a sale  because that will come back to you  whether that person eventually comes and  buys or they tell their friends about  you by doing good and helping your  customers out it will come back to you  and you need to dedicate time every  single day to making that happen  number four is connect on social media I  would pick the channel that you feel  most comfortable with whether it's  YouTube or Twitter or LinkedIn or  Facebook or snapchat whatever it is  spend time every day creating content  not just consuming don't just be a  consumer because you don't make money  being a consumer right you need to make  money by producing something you need to  make money by creating the content and  so if you are into videos put up a  