 to be  constantly adding more things into your  product into your service to make it  better to make it to make it more  nourishing for you because you're  challenging yourself to add something  more in right as entrepreneurs we like  coming up with the ideas and we like  executing on it we're doing the same  thing over and over and over again it  starts to get boring we start to check  out but also it adds value to your  customers so you need to constantly  tweaking constantly doing experiments  they're not always gonna be a big huge  new thing that you're launching but  little tweaks I'm always changing things  on my You Tube channel as an example  since you guys know me through YouTube  I'm changing around the titles I'm  changing around my introduction and  change around how I present this is a  new series that I started right now tell  me what you guys think right and it's a  combination for me of one do you guys  enjoy it and like it and two do I like  it doesn't make me come alive am i  finding joy in doing this what I'm doing  now and when I lose that passion  excitement I'll move on and do something  else  you constantly to be doing tests and  experiments and making your product or  service and better every single day  and number seven is be grateful a lot of  entrepreneurs we're pushing for more we  want to accomplish more we have these  big goals and we're frustrated that  we're not getting there faster you know  I want to hit a million subscribers on  my youtube channel we're doing like 30  km month it's too too slow for me I  wanted to go faster I'm trying to figure  out ways to get it pumped up a little  bit faster and I get that stress as an  entrepreneur but I'm equally also  grateful for everything that's happened  in my life you know I'm grateful for the  team I have for the lifestyle I have for  the country that I live in part of what  I do with the team that I have here is  everyday we have a private Facebook  group we will share three things that  we're grateful for and it just helps you  again set the perspective give you the  proper mindset it helps you just deal  with life better because no matter how  bad your day is today I guarantee you  some people have it worse a lot of  people have it worse most of the world  probably has it worse then your worst  day and keeping that in perspective at  least for me helps give me the  confidence to courage the energy to keep  going and it's a daily habit that I try  to practice that sets my right side up  properly and I hope you guys can at  least give it a shot for the next week  three things every day write it down  that you're grateful for and just try to  feel it you know like write it down and  actually just think about it for five  minutes and at least for me I find that  it makes me almost a totally different  person puts my perspective in check and  helped set me up for the day so that's  my take on the several things you could  do today to make money every day in your  business I'd love to know which of the  seven resonates most with you and I'd  love to know what you might add to the  list leave in the comments below I'm  curious to find out I'm gonna join the  discussion thank you guys so much for  watching continue to believe and I'll  see you soon

